    "Non-enumerating 404: authorize_in_transaction (event.rs:1907-1940) returns EventServiceError::NotFound for both a missing ACL row (unrelated) and a present-but-unauthorized role (viewer/free-busy-viewer), so all denied roles and a non-existent calendar produce the identical 404 not_found.",
    "Content-free logging: import_ics (http.rs:1883-1943) and map_ics_import_error (http.rs:2296-2316) log only actor_user_id, calendar_id, error_code, byte_count, latency_ms, and imported_events/imported_exceptions; access-log and trace middleware log method/path/status/latency only. No calendar content, UID, filename, title, description, or location is ever logged.",
    "Media-type check (http.rs:1945-1951) accepts text/calendar case-insensitively and ignores parameters; empty body and wrong media type both map to 400 invalid_request.",
    "Rate limiting: write_endpoint_tier (rate_limiter.rs:239-248) classifies POST */calendars/*/import-ics as Standard; verified by test_write_endpoint_tier_standard_ics_import."
  ]
};
return JSON.stringify(envelope);

